<!-- Exercise group -->
<xi:include href="./exercises.d/det-inverses.ptx" />

<exercise><p>
	From <xref ref="proposition-inverses-2x2-inverse" /> we have a general formula for the inverse of a <m>2 \times 2</m> matrix:
	<me>
		A = \begin{bmatrix} a \amp b \\ c \amp d \end{bmatrix}
		\quad \Rightarrow \quad
		\inv{A} = \frac{1}{a d - b c} \begin{abmatrix}{rr} d \amp -b \\ -c \amp a \end{abmatrix}
	</me>.
	Use this formula to explicitly verify <xref ref="proposition-more-det-inverse" /> in the <m>2 \times 2</m> case.
</p></exercise>

